<title>USA: U.S. wheat, corn and barley export inspections.</title>
<headline>U.S. wheat, corn and barley export inspections.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Agriculture Department said the 26.287 million bushels of wheat, 29.854 million of corn and 473,000 of barley inspected for export in the week ended Oct 3 were for the following shipment from port areas or inland inspection points (1,000 bu).</p>
<p>	     Wheat     Corn	Barley</p>
<p> Lakes     9,363    1,077	  Nil</p>
<p> Atlantic    Nil	Nil	  Nil</p>
<p> Gulf	6,552   26,113	  Nil</p>
<p> Pacific  10,372    2,068	  473</p>
<p> Interior    Nil	596	  Nil</p>
</text>
